  "title": "Society: Sunlit Cobblemon",
  "description": "The farming of Stardew Valley experience, with Cobblemon at your side doing the farming! A fully integrated spinoff of Society: Sunlit Valley.",
  "body": "**This modpack contains mods that are not on Modrinth! Be sure to download the additional mods prompted by the game after launching.**\n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><strong>Society: Sunlit Cobblemon</strong> is a farming commerce pack in the style of games like&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Stardew Valley</strong></span> and <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Harvest moon</strong></span>, with your Pokémon there to help out build your farm!\n\nAs you progress, you'll use money as well as the Pokémon you catch to purchase new items, upgrade your farm, and craft better tools to make money even faster.</span>\n\nIt is based off the modpack [Society: Sunlit Valley](https://modrinth.com/modpack/society-sunlit-valley) and contains all the features of it, with brand new additions made just for the Cobblemon version.\n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1093382/description_269d7540-a19c-42d4-9f32-c5347326bc07.png\" alt=\"Features banner\" width=\"836\" height=\"105\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Built-in economy</strong></span>: Earn money from shipping various items. Specialize in raising farm animals, brewing wines, looting artifacts, and more!</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Farming</strong></span>: </span> <span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">Every season comes with its own set of crops and fruit trees to grow. C</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">ook and brew various items w</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">ith a variety of mods to increase your profit margins!</span>  \n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>The Skull Cavern</strong></span>: Dive deep into the Skull Cavern, a custom cave dimension that resets daily.&nbsp;Crack open boulders and climb down ropes into more deadly but valuable areas.</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Detailed quests</strong></span>: Want a little guidance? The quest book will give you an in-depth tutorial that takes you through the progression.</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Skills</strong></span>: Progress through 5 custom skill trees, giving you transformative perks for farming, mining, fishing, husbandry, and adventuring!</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Multiplayer</strong></span>: This pack is designed to work well on multiplayer servers, with ways to protect your valuables and trade with other players.</span>\n\n \n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1093382/description_6210458c-28bb-4bf0-88df-3b329877a8c5.png\" alt=\"Farm types banner\" width=\"836\" height=\"105\"></span>\n\n \n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Crops</strong></span>: Work the fields and cultivate a wide array of crops and fruit trees, including the elusive <strong>Ancient Fruit</strong>…</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Animal Husbandry</strong></span>: Raise farm animals with unique affection mechanics! The better you treat your cattle, the more profitable they are.</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Slime Ranching</strong></span>: Ranch over 20 breeds of <strong>Splendid Slimes</strong>. Feed them their favorite foods, collect their Plorts, and turn them into Largos!</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Artisan Goods</strong></span>: Craft cheese, wine, beer, and other high value products. You can even age them in an&nbsp;<strong>Aging Cask</strong> to multiply your profits over time!</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Fish Farming</strong></span>: Put down your fishing rod and place down a <strong>Fish Pond</strong>! Cultivate fish for their roe and other valuables. Complete quests for your demanding fish and level up your ponds.</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Automation</strong></span>: Every single type of farm is completely automatable, though some may take large sums of money and valuable minerals to do so.</span>\n\n \n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1093382/description_47bd4f43-b67c-4d71-8104-3b7df1d43b1b.png\" alt=\"Community banner\" width=\"836\" height=\"105\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">Questions, Feedback or Suggestions? Want to just talk about the pack or find servers to play? Join our <a href=\"https://discord.gg/GdcZkrZqkj\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>! Also check out the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sunlitvalley.miraheze.org/wiki/Main_Page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Society: Sunlit Valley Wiki</a>&nbsp;for information about the pack and a troubleshooting guide.</span>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">Player Made Guides</span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">Fish Pond quest spreadsheet by <strong>Lazerz&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1RlCL9w96E3C4TYx3SuSfBe0YuY4l9e7FF96_olIPFUU/edit?gid=2094650947#gid=2094650947\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">Skull Cavern survival guide by <strong>Devon </strong><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pk3OQxsKQ3hTeuYIA0L-s4yblvyBCfQOMD36CGxXUUw/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.xan6cuu8emq\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">Want to host a server?</span></h2>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">Our partner <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://billing.bloom.host/aff.php?aff=21/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bloom Host</a></strong> offers powerful and convenient server hosting for Sunlit Valley, with dedicated Ryzen 9 CPUs. Use code <strong>SOCIETY</strong> for 25% off your first invoice!</span>\n\n[![Bloom Host](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1093382/description_bca58fec-6bd5-4795-b567-aeeb1009f7e7.gif)](https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://billing.bloom.host/aff.php?aff=21/)\n\n <h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">Media</span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/na4baHF5p4w?si=nUye4H-MTSzdaPAy\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nJ8WWakP3-8?si=c2N173QrgWVQAOmd\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/27CKYWlADLY?si=yHch_mpqEN1ctO6L\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ikZpSo1HV9w?si=W1KTsrJK4zhIVd3Z\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>  undefined\n\n## Additional Credits\n\n*   Shaders provided by [Complementary Reimagined](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-reimagined) - Any issues that arrive should reported to the pack and not the shader devs!\n*   __**Eidolon**__ : Repraised By Alexth99 (Artifact asset)\n*   __**Embers Rekindled**__ - BordListian (Artifact asset)\n*   __**Blazing Drift Fever EX - Eurobeat**__ by CattonArthur (Pigracing music)\n*   __**Uni**__ - Skull Cavern worldgen mastermind\n*   __**Tilles**__\\- Iridium retextures\n*   __**Matt**__ - Skull Cavern structures\n*   **__emma, providencedaemon &__ frog** - Advice, feedback and misc work\n*   __**NerdySpider**__ - Roughly 50 item textures\n*   __**malcolmriley**__ - Various random textures from the [unused-textures](https://github.com/malcolmriley/unused-textures) library",
